..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : FTEXTEDITOR.BSTART.BV
.. Autor          : lei
.. Verantwortlich : fwester
.. Kontrolle      : lei
.. Funktion       : Validiert Eingaben und bestimmt die Art des Menuekoerpers.
.. Functionality  : Validates inputs and defines type of menu body.
...Includes
.. include st/FTEXTEDITOR.SET.LANGUAGE
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. bei FALSE: keine Standardaktion, immer ein Menue oeffnen
.copy M|menuesofort = G|TRUE
..
.. Which type of menu body?
.continue EVENTFT ?  M|subdialog
.copy M|ftextisnew = G|true
.continue DEFAULT
..
!EVENTFT: Get type of freetext for event
.continue ERROR01 ?  F|empty(M|evtvar)
.continue ERROR01 ? _F|defined(A|.M|evtvar)
..
.assign M|freitextart = G|avtvarartalias
.assign M|freitexttyp = M|freitextart >> "ARTF" ? F|regmatch(M|freitextart, "ARTF[0-9]*")
.assign M|freitextdv = 'A|.M|evtvar'
.. get Language from parent buffer
.input "st/FTEXTEDITOR.SET.LANGUAGE"
.. Start bullshit bingo to learn that freetext should be a new one or not!
.assign M|freitextedit = M|freitextdv
.. Empty path always results in a new freetext.
.copy M|ftextisnew = F|empty(M|freitextdv)
.continue OBJSEL ? M|ftextisnew
.. Filled path and <(View)> results in a already existing freetext.
.continue OBJSEL ? M|evtkommd = G|kaktname12
.. Not existing path and <(New|Edit)> results in a already existing freetext.
.continue OBJSEL ? _F|fileexists('M|freitextdv')
.. Existing path and <(New|Edit)> results in a already existing freetext if file is not empty.
.continue OBJSEL ? F|filesize('M|freitextdv') <> 0
.copy M|ftextisnew = G|true
..
!OBJSEL
.copy M|objektwahl = M|freitexttyp^auswahlzeigen
.continue CLRTAB
..
!DEFAULT: Create default menu
.assign M|auswahl = "FTNOP"
.assign M|ftexttyp = ""
..
!CLRTAB
.input "is/TABLEEREN"
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
..
!ERROR01: Field not found!
.error -line 0 -field M|evtvar -message Feld nicht gefunden!
.end 1
